Changelog: 14-11-2026 03:28:21

Breaking. Windows support is removed: this suite is made for and tested on Bazzite. Gone are run.ps1 and install.ps1,
the handling of a suite for Windows devices (its check-release.ps1 on the test buttons and the device test, its
portal's run.ps1 in the commands of a portal release and a withdrawal, its .zip release) and the app ID the tool
registered on Windows for its notifications. Every suite's tests run on this machine, so Device test and the buttons
of Test on this board no longer look at the suite's system. run.sh takes the checkout's .venv-linux (or .venv).

